  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Undertakings-Campsites_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1bf897345ac230148a59fa4f1b012ba3, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 10667745280
    m_Localized: Fix Thimbleton Campsite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 182126698496
    m_Localized: You'd think there was a hotel in a town like this, but you're just
      going to have to rough it when you come here... Unless, that is, you never
      fix this place up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 186249699328
    m_Localized: You've essentially created a hotel! Ok, no room service, but hey,
      other that the efforst and materials you spent on this, it's free accomodations!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 436930666496
    m_Localized: Make the hearth of this area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 558414487552
    m_Localized: Make your bed, the one you sleep in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2214068242407424
    m_Localized: Fix Blu Valley Campsite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2214173364248576
    m_Localized: Ahhh, what we can only imagine is your first campsite, well, in
      this world at least. Get this place up and running and all your dreams will
      come true (as long as you dream of beds, campfires and maybe a torch).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2214178560991232
    m_Localized: Welp, looks like you know where to sleep if you're ever in Blu Valley.
      Thanks to your perseverence and steadfastness, you have a pillow to lay your
      head... just, without the pillow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4446782668464128
    m_Localized: Fix Soothsayer Steppe Campsite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4446876398575616
    m_Localized: 'If you''re hoping to glean any information you can about this place,
      maybe you should fix this place up! I can''t imagine there''s nothing more
      that just a simple campsite here. I mean, it''s in the name, no? '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4446933931843584
    m_Localized: Soothdsayer just might be conjecture, I'm not sure it actually <style="Italic">gleans</style>
      anything. Or are you getting something out of this that only you perceive?
      Either way, one more campsite all fixed up!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 126541932852531200
    m_Localized: Fix Beach Campsite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 126541934156959744
    m_Localized: While most people come to the beach for a relaing moment, here you
      are, asked to fix the place up. Well, look at it this way, when it's all fixed
      up you won't have to do it again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 126541935939538944
    m_Localized: It's done! You can now relax, sunbath, gather shells. Or just go
      off and do anything else. I mean, what, you're gonna just stop doing anything
      and hang out at the beach now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 162082142981836800
    m_Localized: Fix Breezy Peak Campsite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 162082239811538944
    m_Localized: If you had a hat up here it'd blow right off your head, lost forever.
      I guess it's a good thing you don't have that option here... Although I will
      suggest that you fix this place up so as to have a place to hang at least a
      proverbial hat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 162082280550813696
    m_Localized: Now that you've managed to get the campsite all fixed up, i'll admit
      I don't think there's an actual place to hang a hat. I was talking about a
      proverbial hat though, so it's not on me if you have an actual hat and nowhere
      to hang it. But that proverbial hat? You can count on hanging it here somewhere,
      on the proverbial hanger.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
